a High V... I think?

00:18:29.860 --> 00:18:31.690
Okay, big smiles!

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:34.070
Arms up, eyes forward!

00:18:36.230 --> 00:18:40.360
Ugh. My movements are so stiff.

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:44.320
And my smile sucks.

