Let's go...

00:19:10.070 --> 00:19:12.110
Let's go...!

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:15.230
Let's go... Meishiin!

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:17.780
Go, fight, win!

00:19:26.690 --> 00:19:27.610
I'm sorry!

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:28.400
Wh--!

00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:29.860
No, I was just--

00:19:29.860 --> 00:19:31.980
