00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:49.440
W-We're doing it here?

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:51.280
We'll stick out like a sore thumb.

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:53.980
There's no point if we don't.

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:55.900
