00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:05.180
Men's Cheerleading
Club Recruiting
New Members

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:03.530
The Men's Cheerleading Club

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:05.400
will now put on a demonstration!

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:08.860
You there, want to try something new?

00:20:08.860 --> 00:20:11.610
How about you, want
to do something cool?

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:17.230
