00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:07.530
--Let's go, Meishiin!
--The Cheerleading Club.

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:09.150
--Let's go, Meishiin!
--What? But they're guys!

00:21:09.150 --> 00:21:11.030
Go, fight, win!

00:21:11.030 --> 00:21:13.190
Go, fight, win!

00:21:17.610 --> 00:21:19.860
