00:21:22.980 --> 00:21:25.610
--Let's go, Meishiin!
--Meishiin!

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:30.280
Let's go, Meishiin!

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:32.070
Go, fight, win!

00:21:32.070 --> 00:21:33.030
Go!

00:21:33.030 --> 00:21:35.070
Fiiight, win!

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:39.820
We are the Cheer Boys!

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:43.780
The Men's Cheerleading Club
is recruiting talented members!

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:53.440
I thought you would join us.

00:21:53.440 --> 00:21:55.230
No you didn't.

00:21:55.230 --> 00:21:57.980
We wanna do sumthin' new and fun.

00:21:57.980 --> 00:21:58.900
Right?

00:21:58.900 --> 00:22:01.530
With us around, you'll get super popular!

00:22:01.530 --> 00:22:03.320
Now there's six of us.

00:22:03.320 --> 00:22:04.570
Uh-huh!

00:22:04.570 --> 00:22:07.110
We only need one more person
for the school festival.

00:22:07.110 --> 00:22:08.570
Just one more...

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:10.980
Oh, it's those guys from earlier.

00:22:10.980 --> 00:22:13.360
What was it, the Cheerleading Club?

00:22:16.070 --> 00:22:17.690
Whoa!

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:19.320
That was so cool!

00:22:20.570 --> 00:22:21.820
Don't tell me...

00:22:21.820 --> 00:22:25.400
...you two joined just to pick up girls.

00:22:27.980 --> 00:22:31.980
Your First Cheerleader Smile

00:22:41.940 --> 00:22:45.480
<i>Without even thinking, I shouted a reply</i>

00:22:45.480 --> 00:22:52.110
<i>The voice opening that new door</i>
<i>sounded like a tightly clenched fist</i>

00:22:52.110 --> 00:22:55.530
<i>Resounding with reassuring determination</i>

00:22:55.530 --> 00:22:58.900
<i>I think if I let out</i>
<i>(I've been waiting for this)</i>

00:22:58.900 --> 00:23:02.190
<i>All my pent-up energy</i>
<i>(I can change something)</i>

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:08.780
<i>We've always been looking for</i>
<i>something this cool! Ain't that right?</i>

00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:11.690
<i>Feeling insecure</i>
<i>(Oh my God!)</i>

00:23:11.690 --> 00:23:14.980
<i>I fell into a funk</i>
<i>(Oh my pride!)</i>

00:23:14.980 --> 00:23:17.070
<i>Send that old me</i>
<i>(Don't give in!)</i>

00:23:17.070 --> 00:23:18.730
<i>A solid cheer</i>
<i>(Go, go!)</i>

00:23:18.730 --> 00:23:23.230
<i>Make encouraging motions</i>
<i>(Let's dance together!)</i>

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:26.610
<i>Yes! Fly high, fly dive, up and away!</i>

00:23:26.610 --> 00:23:30.360
<i>Never hang your head and give up</i>
<i>(No!) </i>

00:23:30.360 --> 00:23:33.690
<i>Break up, break out, break it to smithereens</i>
<i>(Yes!)</i>

00:23:33.690 --> 00:23:36.980
<i>Smile together, break a sweat, show your guts!</i>
<i>(Guts!)</i>

00:23:36.980 --> 00:23:43.610
<i>Strike a victory pose toward the blue sky</i>
<i>(Jump! Jump! High V!)</i>

00:23:43.610 --> 00:23:46.780
<i>Win over everybody's hearts!</i>

00:23:46.780 --> 00:23:50.150
<i>Go for that moment when</i>
<i>you meet a sparkling smile</i>

00:23:53.480 --> 00:23:58.280
<i>Go, fight! Go, fight, win!</i>

00:24:02.780 --> 00:24:03.900
Risujiro?

00:24:03.900 --> 00:24:05.820
Isn't he one of those advertising mascots?

00:24:05.820 --> 00:24:08.400
Well, I quite like him.

00:24:08.400 --> 00:24:10.320
Squirrels are pretty nimble.

00:24:10.320 --> 00:24:12.860
If only I was more like a squirrel...

00:24:12.860 --> 00:24:15.480
I will become a squirrel!
I will be the Squirrel King!

